{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111730","id":2921276796,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6uHyV8","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111730","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111730.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111730.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111730","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111730/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111730/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111730/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2a816558ab36c528d8c6df37193137502ecec6ae","number":111730,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Implement `FPSLOD` for `AnimationMixer`","user":{"login":"JekSun97","id":130399274,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8W8Kg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130399274?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97","html_url":"https://github.com/JekSun97","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Partially covers: [Implement animation update slicing for animations and bones](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12142)\r\nPossibly solves for: #90943 , #88954 , #99194\r\n\r\nThis adds FPSLOD to optimize animations, this is especially useful for crowd animation, tests have shown a big performance boost, even when implemented with GDScript.\r\nI also added a manual FPSLOD processing mode for specific tasks.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"475\" height=\"556\" alt=\"1\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2b23a78f-a435-404c-87af-64db7d97053a\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nThis also adds the ability to dynamically use frame-by-frame animation in 3D, without complex solutions, such as those described by Blender Studio [here](https://godotengine.org/article/godot-showcase-dogwalk/#were-there-any-quirks-with-the-way-the-material-rendering-and-animations-were-converted-from-blender-to-godot).\r\n\r\n**How it works:**\r\nWhen FPSLOD is enabled, we add new `FPSLODLevel` parameters, which store the distance to activate a given LOD level, as well as the number of frames to skip for animations.\r\nFor example, we have the following levels:\r\n```\r\nLevel 0: Distance=10, Skip Frames: 4\r\nLevel 1: Distance=20, Skip Frames: 6\r\nLevel 2: Distance=25, Skip Frames: 15\r\n```\r\nConsequently, if the active camera is at a distance of 25.0, `AnimationMixer` will skip 15 animation frames, which will reduce CPU load by reducing the number of animation update calls.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/74d76587-e6e1-4d0a-98e5-cd7f4aaa224d\r\n\r\n\r\n**Test Project:**\r\n[test-fpslod.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22984737/test-fpslod.zip) (If the animation does not play, re-import the GLB model.)","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","event